WEBVTT

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.680
Since that idiot came,

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.730
I almost got killed, then poisoned…

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:15.330
It was rough at first, but it’s all better now.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:20.830
Even if it’s temporary,
peace is wonderful.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.650
Ryo-sama!

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:30.610
Allow me to wash your back for you!

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:37.060
W-Why are you here?!

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:40.560
What, isn’t this a standard routine?

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:43.840
I will wash your back for you.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:48.570
N-No, no need, I’ve already washed it myself!

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:52.100
Well, then you can wash <i>my</i>  back!

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:54.570
That’d be great!

00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:56.580
Stop it!

00:00:58.070 --> 00:00:58.910
Brother?

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:02.170
What are you doing, Shizuka-chan?!

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:05.350
It’s a skinship between
fiancé and fiancée.

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:07.670
Ack! Help!

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:09.510
Stop it, Shizuka-chan!

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:12.340
Oh?! Oh?!

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:16.210
Ryo-sama!

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:30.780
So I don’t spill my wish from my eyes,

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:37.640
I want to make my heart race to you.

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:45.000
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.590
and paint them on my heart.

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:53.550
The sweetness

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:58.640
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.090
The time

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:06.520
is drawing bells in the sky.

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:14.650
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:16.540
float in the wind,

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:18.420
flowing toward you,

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:21.890
freely.

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:28.710
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:32.340
It’s filling with colors.

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:37.340
Dragon and Tiger
of Love and Ambition
Great Crash!!

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.420
Welcome.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:50.120
The name of this store is Plavi.

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:53.740
My brother and I work part-time here.

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.520
Enjoy your stay.

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:06.000
He is Haru.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.760
Real name Mukasa Haruki.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:10.960
He has been our guardian since we lost our parents.

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:13.940
He is the owner and
the master of this store.

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:16.970
Yet he does nothing as a master.

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:21.760
He spends his time on his real job at his designated seat every day.

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:29.270
But, according to Haru, his mere
existence in the store helps sales.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:34.900
Today too, there were guys who came to see the heroine, my sister, Akane,

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.780
and girls who came to see Haru,

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:37.420
making the store busy.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:38.350
Haru-sama!

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:40.010
So handsome!

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:40.900
Marry me!

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:42.690
An order coming.

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:44.400
2 house blends, please.

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:46.370
Yes, right away.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:50.420
Ryo-kun, were you just looking at someone else?

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:53.800
Don’t try to cheat on her.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:59.150
Huh? Yurika-san, cheating is for someone who has a girlfriend.

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:00.760
I don’t…

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.310
I heard about it though!

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:05.300
Ryo-kun,

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:07.810
are you two deeply in love?

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.400
Oh, that’s stupid.

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:14.020
I would love to meet
your so called fiancée.

00:04:14.670 --> 00:04:16.510
This is Meno Yurika-san.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.510
She’s also a heroine of the store, just like Akane.

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:22.030
She’s dating Haru, but that’s being kept
a secret between us to protect the business.

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:24.080
Welcome.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.100
She’s here, Yurika-san.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.540
The idiot of the year.

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:30.160
Hello.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:33.000
Ryo-sama, I had to come.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:37.980
So she’s your…

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.660
She’s cute.

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:41.550
She’s so nasty inside though.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:44.830
So, who is this honest person, Ryo-sama?

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.550
She’s my co-worker, Meno Yurika-san.

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:49.130
Nice to meet you.

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:50.800
I’m Masuda Shizuka.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:52.430
Pleased to meet you.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.060
Yurika-san, here.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:54.520
Yes.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:56.650
Enjoy.

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.990
You are Mukasa Haruki-sama, right?

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:08.740
Hello. My name is Masuda Shizuka.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.120
Masuda?

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.080
Yes.

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:14.120
I’m very pleased to meet you.

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:19.210
Who’s this bitch?

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.600
So rude!

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:22.710
What a wench!

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:25.620
Sorry for the interruption, Haru.

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:27.380
That idiot wouldn’t listen to me.

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:29.800
No prob.

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:31.580
He’s in a bad mood!

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:32.300
That idiot!

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.420
Now, Akane-san,

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:39.110
please, go take a break.

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:42.160
But, Shizuka-chan…

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:43.110
Don’t worry.

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:47.780
I’m a super flower of Japanese womanhood,
so I’m excellent at waiting on customers.

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.820
Please let me help.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:51.240
Miss.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:52.120
Yes?

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:56.040
Don’t take their jobs lightly.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.340
This is their workplace.

00:05:58.340 --> 00:05:59.630
I won’t allow any disturbances.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:02.000
I won’t be a disturbance.

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:05.010
It is not up to you to decide that.

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:07.580
Draw a line between public and private matters.

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:08.510
Yes.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:11.010
Go, Haru!

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:13.040
He made her shut up with just one line!

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.440
Attaboy!

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:22.610
But you wouldn’t kick out a customer by force, would you?

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:23.800
Of course not.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:27.120
I welcome anyone.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:36.700
P-Please stop!

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.380
No thank you!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:39.830
Akane!

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:42.320
But why?

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:43.540
Come on.

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.160
Please stop.

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:46.580
What’s the matter?

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:46.840
Come on.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.000
Please stop!

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:48.630
No thank you!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.040
Again?

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.010
Don’t hate me.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:54.800
But…

00:06:54.800 --> 00:06:58.840
Okay, mister, don’t touch our girls.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:00.310
W-What the hell?!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:01.760
Ouch!

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:02.560
What did you do that for?!

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:05.360
Oh? Doesn’t it look like
I was trying to stop you?

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:09.510
Trying to look cool in front of girls?

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:10.120
Go to Hell!

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:16.520
Brother!

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:17.370
Ryo-kun…

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.050
Who are you guys?!

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:38.400
Everyone has the same face?!

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:43.120
Please escort him out.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:46.400
And do it so that he will never come back here.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.060
Stop it! Hey!

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:00.750
Take care!

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:07.440
Are you okay?

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:09.200
Thanks.

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:10.320
What about you?

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:12.000
I’m really fine.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:13.510
And you too, Shizuka-chan.

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:15.160
You’re very welcome.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:18.510
It’s only my duty
to protect my future sister.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:20.520
S-Sister?

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.520
Well, anyway, thanks.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.520
Would you please deny it, Akane?

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:25.980
What was that about?

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:26.940
I don’t know.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:30.030
Now, today’s attraction is over.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:32.440
Oh, it was all planned.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:33.650
It hit me by surprise.

00:08:34.320 --> 00:08:37.120
I wanted to see Haru-sama’s cool actions.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.360
Sorry, Haru.

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:39.950
I couldn’t control myself.

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:42.120
No need to apologize.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.460
It was fine to protect Akane back then.

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:46.710
The problem is…

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:57.660
Are you trying to tell me that my course of action was wrong?

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:03.810
Do you not feel responsible for breaking the precious mood of the store

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.800
by calling in that rude bunch of men?

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:12.780
Then was I supposed to let it go?

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.950
What’s in question was the method used.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.950
I’m scared!

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.680
I know those types.

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:27.960
He would have harmed Ryo-sama later for revenge!

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.470
I’m confident that it was best

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:36.800
for my men to deal with him in a
perfect manner, for future safety.

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:40.300
Oh?

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.800
Destroying this store is not enough,

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:45.310
so now you’re trying to make me owe it to you?

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:49.060
Oh no, that is not my intention at all.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:52.360
Then let us talk based on the clear facts.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:55.400
That would be rational here.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:57.580
Well…

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:02.520
This is…

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:04.920
Loss of the regulars,

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:06.000
damages to our name,

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.250
and destruction of store property.

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:13.550
It is a bill of indemnification for all of the losses listed.

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:16.550
But what is this solatium fee?

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:19.230
I lost my chance to increase my reputation among the female customers,

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:22.550
and my chance to relieve stress.

00:10:23.180 --> 00:10:26.560
I need monetary compensation for the pain I have suffered.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:30.640
That’s not fair!

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:33.280
Oh no!

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:41.030
You crook master!

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:43.120
Did you say something?

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:47.800
Well then, Haruki-sama, even though my method was wrong,

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:51.000
it’s also true that I did it to protect Akane-san and this shop.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.540
What about that?

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:56.130
You will receive a sincere thank-you from Ryo.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:10:59.320
Wonderful!

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:01.640
Then I will deal with things like so.

00:11:01.880 --> 00:11:03.320
Wait a sec, Haru!

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:05.640
Are you trying to use me in this deal?!

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:07.520
Don’t blame me.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:12.520
It’s only natural to be nice to the person who saved your own sister.

00:11:12.840 --> 00:11:14.800
That’s true, but…

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.560
In that case, Dear Brother,

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:17.480
What is it?

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:18.200
DEAR
BROTHER

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:18.360
BROTHER
DEAR

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:22.030
Would you please deny that title, Haru?

00:11:22.340 --> 00:11:27.290
I would be forgiven if I have a dinner with Ryo-sama alone?

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:29.760
Of course.

00:11:29.760 --> 00:11:31.750
Go get as much appreciation as you like.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:32.780
Yes!

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:35.260
How could this be happening?!

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.480
This is too much!

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:38.280
Haru, you devil!

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:39.840
The ultimate utilitarian!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:43.680
I suffered treason from my team,
and fell into a dire situation!

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:44.270
Where will tomorrow lead me?!

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:46.320
To be continued

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:47.810
Ryo-sama!

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:49.230
To be continued

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:53.680
The moment came

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:57.680
very much out of the blue.

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:02.820
You showed up right in front of me,

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:05.540
then started to change everything.

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:09.370
If my meeting you

00:12:10.270 --> 00:12:13.220
is not by fate,

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:18.580
there are no miracles,

00:12:18.580 --> 00:12:23.770
even if I search all over the world.

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:27.160
Embracing love,

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:31.090
kissing love,

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:35.020
holding love,

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:39.320
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:43.350
Please look at me and me alone,

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:46.770
forever.
